# Build artifacts of the kernel - not sources, placed here by the build.
# 🔴 MediaTek and iKKO blobs are NOT INCLUDED in publication: they are vendor property.
#    The list of needed files is in proprietary-files.txt, extracted from the device
#    by the extract-files.py script.
kernel/Image
kernel/dtbo.img
kernel/dtb/
kernel/modules/
*.ko
*.img
*.so
*.apk
*.jar
*.bin
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.bak
*.bak-*
*.orig
*.rej

# MediaTek speech tuning tables. Extracted from the device by extract-files.py and adjusted
# in place by audio_param_tuning.py -- the tables are MediaTek's and are never committed here.
configs/audio_param/Speech_AudioParam.xml
configs/audio_param/SpeechVol_AudioParam.xml
